---
---
<section class="section" style="background: rgba(41, 7, 28, 0.6);" aria-labelledby="arch-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="section-tag">Audio Standards</span>
      <h2 id="arch-title" class="section-headline">
        Built for clear, direct sound control
      </h2>
      <p class="section-intro">
        Your audio tools run in the browser, with uncompressed WAV export where available.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
      <div style="background: var(--bg-surface-glass); border: 1px solid var(--border-card); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <div style="width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: rgba(231, 146, 127, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(231, 146, 127, 0.25); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-brand-peach); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">0 file uploads</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Your audio files and music never leave your device. All retuning happens locally in your browser’s memory.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-surface-glass); border: 1px solid var(--border-card); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <div style="width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: rgba(231, 146, 127, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(231, 146, 127, 0.25); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-brand-peach); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Real-time playback</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Sound waves are generated live by your browser with smooth volume curves to prevent clicks and pops.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="background: var(--bg-surface-glass); border: 1px solid var(--border-card); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <div style="width: 2.25rem; height: 2.25rem; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: rgba(231, 146, 127, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(231, 146, 127, 0.25); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--color-brand-peach); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
            <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
            <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Lossless WAV export</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Export uncompressed WAV files ready for headphones, offline listening, or use in creative projects.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
